# sent_id = lotus_sutra_0002
# text_lzh = 爾時無盡意菩薩。即從座起。偏袒右肩合掌向佛而作是言。世尊。觀世音菩薩。以何因緣。名觀世音。
# text_en = Thereupon Endless-Intent Bodhisattva rose from his seat, bared his right shoulder, joined his hands together towards the Buddha, and said, “World-Honored One! Why is World-Voice-Perceiver Bodhisattva called World-Voice-Perceiver?” 
